{"pin":"AB03257","subcodes":[{"code":"AB03257","anchor":"","first_line":"O thou who art attracted by the fragrances of God! I have read thy letter addressed to the dear Anton Effendi [3.5s]... ...Regarding the statement in The Hidden Words, that man must renounce his own self, the meaning is that he must renounce his inordinate desires","first_line_orig":"ایتها المنجذبه بنفحات الله انی قرئت تحریرک المرسل الی انطون افندی العزیز  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"320","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"en","lang_name":"English"}],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DAK#0219","source":"BRL_DAK","locator":"0219","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/946491841"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK1#181 p.201x","source":"MMK1","locator":"181 p.201x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/347421495"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MNMK#050 p.134x","source":"MNMK","locator":"050 p.134x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MMAB/mmab-132.html"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BLO_PN#026x","source":"BLO_PN","locator":"026x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/goodall_cooper_daily_lessons"},{"kind":"translation","code":"DLA.090x","source":"DLA","locator":"090x","url":"https://books.google.com/books?id=qk9OAQAAMAAJ\u0026pg=PA90"},{"kind":"translation","code":"LOG#0596x","source":"LOG","locator":"0596x","url":"http://bahai-library.com/hornby_lights_guidance.html\u0026chapter=2#n596"},{"kind":"translation","code":"SWAB#181x","source":"SWAB","locator":"181x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/747567430"}]}]}
